WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Start with the editable garden-house scene.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Press V and select a roof stroke. Use G and drag to move it.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Undo and redo to compare the original and moved geometry.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Orbit to inspect the change in three dimensions.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Press B and draw a short detail on the current plane.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:52.000
If the plane is edge-on, press F to align the view.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Save a separate copy, then reopen it to confirm the strokes remain editable.
